  "decisions": [
    "The authenticated dashboard uses a restrained open-study-journal layout: a spacious entry page on the left, a denser analytics and calendar page on the right, a warm paper palette in light mode, and muted charcoal journal paper in dark mode.",
    "The public homepage presents the product as the closed cover of the same study journal, with Log in and Sign up access repeated in both the cover and the top navigation.",
    "Authentication screens are presented as a single cream inside-cover journal page, with the dark cloth cover peeking around the page, ruled form fields, handwritten annotations, and a consistent route back to the journal cover."
